00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.620
Speaker 4: Hi.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.620
Chester Springs, Pennsylvania, outside of
Philadelphia.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:16.620
Love it.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:17.620
That's us.

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:18.840
