00:06:30.169 --> 00:06:37.820
I mean, my view is that I am 100% opposed
to these right wing Israeli governments, Netanyahu,

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:38.820
etc..

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:41.430
I'm against illegal settlements.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:45.169
I would like to see the blockade with Gaza
ended.

00:06:45.169 --> 00:06:51.300
And I also recognize that it's simply not
going to end until there are either certain

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:56.050
concessions or assurances that come from Hamas,
which is extraordinarily unlikely.

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:58.400
And it's such a complicated issue.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:03.240
Genio But I think I'm often attacked as being
a shill for Israel.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:06.419
And a lot of that is unfortunately, just because
I'm Jewish.

00:07:06.419 --> 00:07:12.389
And it's disappointing to see that when it
comes to policy, if you look at I've probably

00:07:12.389 --> 00:07:20.590
done it ten times now, if you look at my policy
idea for how to resolve the conflict, I think

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:25.759
it's it's quite fair and both sides could
probably find issue with it.

00:07:25.759 --> 00:07:28.220
But I think there's one other important thing.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:32.810
One of the things that's unfortunate is there
is a standard applied to Israel when it comes

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:37.920
to, quote, supporting the country, which might
include like even going on a trip that no

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:40.979
one applies to other countries, which I would
like to see changed.

00:07:40.979 --> 00:07:48.389
Like, for example, if people very few people
see, like, for example, I went to England

00:07:48.389 --> 00:07:51.860
